inimize Emissions And/or Correct the Situation: Investigated the source of the potential leak to initiate corrective action","match_basis":"ongoing (started 2025-03-04)","travel_h":0.33,"travel_speed_mph":9.2,"travel_distance_km":4.9,"start_to_spike_h":44.0,"arrival_local":"2025-03-04T10:19","spike_hour_local":["2025-03-06T06:00","2025-03-06T07:00"]}},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_0307","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[93.0,100.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On March 6, 2025, the Texas state monitor at Manchester East Ave N recorded 19.23 ppb of benzene in the 6:00 a.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.265 ppb. Wind there came from 100 degrees at 9.2 mph. 37 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. One of them, Pasadena Refinery, filed emissions-event report 437195 for 50 pounds of benzene from 10:00 to 10:00 local time that day. These readings are consistent with that release reaching the monitors. Requested follow-up: confirm whether nearby residents were notified, and whether the reported amount accounts for these readings.","draft_es":"El 6 de marzo de 2025, el monitor estatal de Texas en Manchester East Ave N registró 19.23 ppb de benceno en la hora de las 6:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.265 ppb. El viento venía de 100 grados a 9.2 mph. Hay 37 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. Una de ellas, Pasadena Refinery, presentó el informe de evento de emisiones 437195 por 50 libras de benceno de 10:00 a 10:00, hora local, ese día. Estas lecturas son consistentes con que esa emisión llegó a los monitores. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si se avisó a los residentes cercanos y si la cantidad reportada explica estas lecturas.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0069_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87507,"sha256":"32c6191a68a6eb169dd6e26d6775c5854ffb61f4502a4db47a3543dc085967c3","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:43+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0307_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88633,"sha256":"fdb894876a95d29142128960f5003a95868a7261c800a37aeb0d09e5c74aa2fb","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:05+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0057_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0057","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88143,"sha256":"936337ee67a1b4235ab26abc1914890274dc0f26a86a55b6baf9249c31968fbd","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:28+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_1614_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_1614","user_param":"45201","u